      <p>Check out the cool branded merchandise in our shop to support the station.</p>
      <a href="https://redlampradio.com/merchandise/" class="btn">Browse Merch</a>
    </div>
    <div class="action-card">
      <h3>Recorded Podcasts</h3>
      <p>Catch up on missed shows and exclusive recorded sessions on our official SoundCloud archive.</p>
      <a href="https://soundcloud.com/user-600534076" target="_blank" class="btn">Listen on SoundCloud</a>
    </div>
    <div class="action-card">
      <h3>Work With Us</h3>
      <p>We're mostly manned by volunteers with a love for radio. Get involved!</p>
      <a href="https://redlampradio.com/work-with-us/" class="btn">Join the Team</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mid-Page Ad Showcase Position -->
  <div class="sponsor-showcase">
    <h3>Featured Station Partner & Sponsor</h3>
    <div class="sponsor-banner-box">
      Prime Ad Slot / Sponsor Banner (728x90)
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>Our Ethos is Simple</h2>
      <p>We're big enough to manage, small enough to care, & good enough to deliver a wonderful radio experience.</p>
      <p>Variety is absolutely key here, with all styles of music & genre's represented, & we particularly champion unsigned bands & artists, so get in touch all you budding stars!</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Red Lamp Radio | Operated by Soudini</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const hamburgerBtn = document.getElementById('hamburgerBtn');
    const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobileMenu');

    hamburgerBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      mobileMenu.classList.toggle('show');
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>
